   362	
   363	"She never needed me. That's the best morning I've had on this road since the thaw."
   364	
   365	"She kept her feet. Near enough."
   366	
   367	"She did. Tell her that somebody saw."
   368	
   369	Oryn got up, and went to see to the mule.

