    45	
    46	It is the 291st day. After the alley the working party goes by the carts' street in daylight, with the boxes on a borrowed handcart. Karis's left hand is bound in a strip of Brom's shirt. Cael has eleven fragments and the eleventh has nothing to do. The clerk has not asked three things.
