    61	**Cutaways (~4,500):** Vastin, ~2,000, alone after the leaf. "Aimed." His sentence stays stopped in his head too. **He does not join the leaf to the sigils, does no date arithmetic, and names no seals.** Oryn, ~2,500, at a hold on her route, where a fourteen-year-old's Kindling happens. She watches a child see a sigil nobody else can see, and thinks of a dark one. **She has not heard the leaf. Nobody dies.**
